{"speciesId":445,"names":{"fr":"Carchacrok","es":"Garchomp","en":"Garchomp","ja":"ガブリアス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"When it folds up its body and extends its wings, it looks like a jet plane. It flies at sonic speed."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It flies at speeds equal to a jet fighter plane. It never allows its prey to escape."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It is said that when one runs at high speed, its wings create blades of wind that can fell nearby trees."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its body is covered in fine scales that reduce drag, enabling it to fly at high speeds."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its body is covered in fine scales that reduce drag, enabling it to fly at high speeds."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"On dit que lancé à pleine vitesse, il crée des lames de vent avec ses ailes pouvant trancher un arbre."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It is said that when one runs at high speed, its wings create blades of wind that can fell nearby trees."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"On dit que lancé à pleine vitesse, il crée des lames de vent avec ses ailes pouvant trancher un arbre."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It is said that when one runs at high speed, its wings create blades of wind that can fell nearby trees."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It is said that when one runs at high speed, its wings create blades of wind that can fell nearby trees."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It is said that when one runs at high speed, its wings create blades of wind that can fell nearby trees."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Quand il se recroqueville et étend ses ailes, on dirait un chasseur. Sa vitesse est supersonique."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Cuando despliega su cuerpo y sus alas, parece un avión a reacción. Vuela a velocidad sónica."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"When it folds up its body and extends its wings, it looks like a jet plane. It flies at sonic speed."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"体を 折り畳み 翼を 伸ばすと まるで ジェット機。 音速で 飛ぶことが できる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il vole à la vitesse d’un avion à réaction et ne lâche jamais sa proie."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Vuela tan rápido como un avión a reacción. Nunca se le escapa una presa."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It flies at speeds equal to a jet fighter plane. It never allows its prey to escape."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"ジェット戦闘機に 負けない スピードで 空を 飛ぶ。 ねらった 獲物は 逃がさない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Quand il se recroqueville et étend ses ailes, on dirait un chasseur. Sa vitesse est supersonique."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Cuando despliega su cuerpo y sus alas, parece un avión a reacción. Vuela a velocidad sónica."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"When it folds up its body and extends its wings, it looks like a jet plane. It flies at sonic speed."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"体を 折り畳み 翼を 伸ばすと まるで ジェット機。 音速で 飛ぶことが できる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il vole à la vitesse d’un avion à réaction et ne lâche jamais sa proie."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Vuela tan rápido como un avión a reacción. Nunca se le escapa una presa."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It flies at speeds equal to a jet fighter plane. It never allows its prey to escape."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"ジェット戦闘機に 負けない スピードで 空を 飛ぶ。 ねらった 獲物は 逃がさない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il vole aussi vite qu’un avion à réaction. Si en vol il croise une nuée de Pokémon oiseaux, il les avale d’une seule bouchée."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Vuela tan rápido como un avión a reacción. Embiste a bandadas de Pokémon pájaro y, si atrapa a alguno, se lo traga de un bocado."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It can fly at speeds rivaling jet planes. It dives into flocks of bird Pokémon and gulps the entire flock down whole."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"ジェット機 並の 高速で 飛ぶ。 とりポケモンの 群れに 突っ込むと そのまま 群れごと 丸呑みだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Les deux protubérances qu’il a sur la tête lui servent de capteurs. Il peut ainsi détecter les mouvements de proies très éloignées."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Las dos protuberancias que tiene en la cabeza le sirven de sensores. Puede rastrear presas que se encuentren a gran distancia."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"The protuberances on its head serve as sensors. It can even detect distant prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"頭に ついた ２つの 突起は センサーの 役目。 遥か 先の 獲物の 様子も わかる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il vole à la vitesse du son en quête de nourriture. Drattak et lui se disputent souvent leurs proies dans des combats aériens impressionnants."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Surca el aire a velocidad supersónica en busca de presas y no duda en librar una batalla aérea con un Salamence para quedarse con ellas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It flies at the speed of sound while searching for prey, and it has midair battles with Salamence as the two compete for food."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"音速で 飛び 獲物を 探す。 エサを 巡り ボーマンダと 空中戦を 繰り広げる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"En plus de maximiser son aérodynamisme, ses écailles lisses et pointues ont l’avantage de blesser ses ennemis quand ils l’attaquent."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Sus escamas, pequeñas, lisas y afiladas, no solo lo hacen más aerodinámico, sino que le sirven para herir al rival que ose atacarlo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its fine scales don’t just reduce wind resistance—their sharp edges also cause injury to any opponent who attacks it."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"きめ細かく 尖った ウロコは 空気抵抗を 減らすだけでなく 襲ってきた 相手を 傷つけるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Vivant dans les massifs volcaniques, ce Pokémon chasse ses proies dans le ciel en volant aussi vite qu’un avion à réaction."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Habita en montañas de origen volcánico. Vuela tan rápido como un avión a reacción en busca de presas."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Garchomp makes its home in volcanic mountains. It flies through the sky as fast as a jet airplane, hunting down as much prey as it can."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"火山性の 山に すみつく。 ジェット機に 負けない 速さで 空を 飛び 獲物を 狩りまくる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ce Pokémon très rapide même au sol capture ses proies sur les monts enneigés et rentre vite dans son antre avant que son corps ne gèle."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Se mueve a gran velocidad incluso por tierra. Es capaz de cazar una presa en una montaña nevada y volver a su guarida sin llegar a pasar frío."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Garchomp is fast both underground and above. It can bring down prey and return to its den before its body has chilled from being outside."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"地上でも 動きは 素早く 雪山で 体が 冷えきるまえに 獲物を しとめ すみかに 戻る。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Soars across the heavens at blinding speed—a magnificent sight! It has a feral disposition. Utmost caution is required if one meets a Garchomp out in the wilds."}],"varieties":[{"id":445,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"na